00:12:43.390 --> 00:12:46.990
because the business model
can't sustain it anymore.

00:12:46.990 --> 00:12:49.510
Who do you see as your
closest competition right now?

00:12:49.510 --> 00:12:50.980
We are our own competition.

00:12:50.980 --> 00:12:53.320
I'm not overly commercial
about this either.

00:12:53.320 --> 00:12:56.380
Like I don't want to squeeze it to a point

00:12:56.380 --> 00:12:57.940
that it actually loses its soul.

00:12:57.940 --> 00:12:59.950
Like that would also not be success to me.

00:13:01.390 --> 00:13:04.450
We're seeing the world's
biggest billionaires also

00:13:04.450 --> 00:13:05.830
getting into media.

00:13:05.830 --> 00:13:07.000
Mark Benioff with Time.

00:13:07.000 --> 00:13:10.150
